      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MABEL'S MAGIC (4) jumps from box 4 for the first time after placing latest at Angle Park (19.71) in a Other. Has never missed the frame at the trip from three starts. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Sure to be about the mark. MAKE SOME NOISE (7) goes very well this course and distance starting six times for two wins and three minors. Hit the frame latest (16.64) when second at Murray Bridge in a Grade 5. Looks suited here and can measure up. LOVE SHINE (8) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and three placings from six starts. Hit the frame latest (19.79) when third at Angle Park in a Other. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. MINH JACK (2) is building a nice sequence of wins – hard to fault that form.",
